{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"歐聯精華｜曼聯半場輸兩球　奇蹟反勝羅馬／巴塞清風送爽　三蛋贈維拉\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CL-HL-261104.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月4日歐聯賽事精華：</p><p>馬德里體育會 0:2 拜仁慕尼黑</p><p>曼聯 3:2 羅馬</p><p>巴塞羅那 3:0 阿士東維拉</p><p>其餘賽事賽果：</p><p>維拉利爾 0:6 巴黎聖日耳門</p><p>飛燕諾 0:3 國際米蘭</p><p>博德基林 0:0 里爾</p><p>加拉塔沙雷 2:0 史特加</p><p>薩克達 0:1 士砵亭</p><p>連斯體育會 4:0 布拉迪斯拉發斯拉夫人</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:25:24.831114+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T00:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:39:02.223901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:19:02.059631+00:00","content_hash":"df8a333f4db988ee6af4d09144465a75b4f4e3c1f50c9aacdbaa0c1206a4b919","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}